  m_Name: B2 has all keys
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueStateSO
  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: My hand dives into my procket and retrieves all three
      keys I gathered during my dream.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: With a 'click', each one of them breaks their respective
      locks wide open without any issue.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: As I wonder how move the massive door, the solution presents
      itself to me, as it starts magically moving on its own in a loud creaking,
      like it hasn't been opened in a century.
    TextAlignment: 257
